-- TOPIC 5.  Logical AND 
   -- It is used when more than one condition need to satisfy to retrive the data.
   --  Example 1:- Print title, author_lname and released year for the books who's authors last name is gaiman, released year
                  is greater than 2010 and title contains "Myth".

       SELECT 
    title, author_lname, released_year
FROM
    books
WHERE
    author_lname = 'Gaiman'
        AND released_year > 2010
        AND TITLE LIKE '%Myth%';

--  IMP-  Alsways remember both LEFT AND RIGHT both should be TRUE only then query will work and give result.

